        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, we have made significant investments in order to attract, develop, and retain talented personnel, inclusive of competitive pay, benefits, training, and professional development opportunities.",
