        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on this approach, we operate through three reportable segments: Aerospace & Industrial, Defense Electronics, and Naval & Power.",
        "start_character": 4842,
        "end_character": 4975
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007587",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007587-5041764377f4b68e",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007587",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are developing critical subsea pumping technology for the oil and gas industry, leveraging our experience and existing technology as a long-term producer of canned motor pumps for the U.S.",
